file other.md
# Other doc

Linked from doc.md.
end
file notes.txt
plain text notes
end
run doc.md
wait # Split preview
snap source
key ctrl+p
type toggle split
wait Markdown: Toggle Split
snap toggle-split-palette
key enter
wait Jump to the other doc
snap split-on
key down*7 alt+right
type  Live.
wait and italic words. Live.
snap live
key down*30
wait 37/89
snap cursor-sync
wheel 20 10 down 3
wait 49 Paragraph 7
snap editor-wheel
wheel 90 10 down 3
wait 56 Paragraph 8
snap preview-wheel
click 90 20
key down*4
wait 61 ## Section 9
snap preview-keys
key esc
type !
wait • item 5a!
snap esc-back-to-editor
wheel 90 10 up 30
wait the other doc
click 70 3
wait Linked from doc.md
snap link
key alt+,
wait Jump to the other doc
snap back
click 88 3
wait plain text notes
snap plain-buffer
key alt+,
wait • item 3a
snap markdown-again
config
{"plugins": {"markdown": {"split_width": 25}}}
end
wait-gone Paragraph 4 has bold and italic words.
snap width-hot-reload
key alt+p
wait click a link to open it
snap overlay-over-split
key pgdn
wait-gone Section 4
snap overlay-scrolled
key esc
wait-gone click a link to open it
snap overlay-closed-split-follows
key alt+o
type notes.txt
wait notes.txt
key enter
wait plain text notes
key ctrl+p
type toggle split
key enter
key alt+,
wait Paragraph
snap toggled-off-from-plain
